# Contact form delivery. Without this the form reports that it is unavailable
# and points visitors at the email address directly.
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Guestbook storage.
#
# The guestbook is shared between visitors, so it needs somewhere real to keep
# entries. Any Postgres works: the free tier of Neon or Supabase, or a database
# on a box you own. Nothing here ties the site to its host.
#
# Use the POOLED connection string, not the direct one. Serverless runs many
# short-lived instances and pointing them all at a direct connection exhausts
# the server's connection limit; both Neon and Supabase hand out a pooler URL
# for exactly this. On Supabase it is the one on port 6543.
#
# The table is created on first use, so there is no migration to run.
#
# With this unset the guestbook falls back to an in-process list so local
# development works out of the box. That list is per-instance and does not
# survive a restart, and on serverless each instance has its own, so entries
# will not be shared. The window says as much when it is running that way.
DATABASE_URL=
